            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Back ache is a rare phenomenon in children and adolescents, but it is always caused by serious pathologic changes. The aim of this study was to point to pediatricians to the importance of anamnesis and clinical examinations in making a diagnosis.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
